# The four udaeus hero gods. The book states only that all are Lawful except Pelori,
# who is Chaotic Good; the precise alignments, domains and favoured weapons below are
# inferred from each portfolio so that clerics and warpriests can actually pick them.
Udaeus	ALIGN:LN	DESC:Udaeus hero god of battle and the right to rule	DOMAINS:War,Glory,Law,Nobility,Strength,Tactics Subdomain,Blood Subdomain,Martyr Subdomain,Ferocity Subdomain,Inevitable Subdomain|PREALIGN:LN,LG,LE,TN	DEITYWEAP:Longspear|Shortspear	FACTSET:Pantheon|Celmae	SOURCEPAGE:Celmae
Tuath	ALIGN:LG	DESC:Udaeus hero god of redemption and second chances	DOMAINS:Good,Healing,Law,Protection,Repose,Restoration Subdomain,Purity Subdomain,Archon Subdomain (Good),Archon Subdomain (Law)|PREALIGN:LG,LN,NG,TN	DEITYWEAP:Morningstar	FACTSET:Pantheon|Celmae	SOURCEPAGE:Celmae
Pelori	ALIGN:CG	DESC:Udaeus hero god of knowledge, art and free inquiry	DOMAINS:Knowledge,Good,Chaos,Magic,Rune,Memory Subdomain,Thought Subdomain,Language Subdomain,Azata Subdomain (Chaos),Azata Subdomain (Good)|PREALIGN:CG,NG,CN,TN	DEITYWEAP:Quarterstaff	FACTSET:Pantheon|Celmae	SOURCEPAGE:Celmae
